# Text files have LF line endings in the working copy on every machine, as they have in git, so what reads them as
# they are (the build's source map, the tests, a diff) sees the same bytes on Windows as on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.br binary
*.gz binary
